# Generated output. Prettier's built-in ignore list is essentially `node_modules`, and
# `format:check` is `prettier --check .` — so without this file the lockfile and the build
# directory are checked, and a fresh app fails its own format gate the moment it builds.
#
# `.gitignore` already knows what is generated here, and neither Prettier nor ESLint reads it.
# Three lists, one fact: keep them in step.
node_modules
dist
coverage
.theokit
pnpm-lock.yaml
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
